// self-hosted::compiler::render_native_compile_driver_lean
//
// Ultra-lean native compile driver with micro-emitter.
// Avoids NativeCompiler by-value returns (broken under Cranelift JIT).
// Uses ONLY CodeBuffer by-value returns (65KB, proven JIT-safe).
//
// Pipeline: parse → flat IR summary → per-body lower → micro-emit x86-64 → inline ELF → write
//
// Usage:
//   souc run self-hosted/compiler/render_native_compile_driver_lean.sio -- <source> <output>

